  "selection": [
    "Reject the first CC-background trial: it changed the textured surround but left every ability-paper color patch identical. The source asset does not own the procedural paper fill.",
    "Fit the procedural paper separately, preserving its240/255 alpha and existing shape. Bounded channel gains change only the selected source/palette, without moving text, frame or masks.",
    "Keep existing CC background HSB, title/type materials, mana, footer and shield geometry. Regular blue has only a foil reference in M21 and retains shared defaults."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Six material cohorts, with4 tall-blue printings but only1 eligible printing for each other palette. Mean color error is not a perceptual fidelity percentage.",
    "The same paper palette is a proposed default for related foil-only faces; those scans were not used to fit color and no such transfer is claimed by this trial.",
    "Plane typography, symbol/loyalty placement and header/surround colors still require audit; this receipt proves the paper region only."
  ],
